iều khoản. Huỷ bất cứ lúc nào."}]}}}],"endscreen":{"endscreenRenderer":{"elements":[{"endscreenElementRenderer":{"style":"CHANNEL","image":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lxtNG-CBHjxZd5NFNZ1JETn16mt3p0MwbBWbHzXLMgWW8=s250-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","width":250,"height":250},{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lxtNG-CBHjxZd5NFNZ1JETn16mt3p0MwbBWbHzXLMgWW8=s400-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","width":400,"height":400}]},"icon":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://www.gstatic.com/youtube/img/annotations/youtube.png"}]},"left":0.82280701,"width":0.15438597,"top":0.54906541,"aspectRatio":1,"startMs":"128208","endMs":"133208","title":{"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"Learn English by Pocket Passport, kênh"}},"simpleText":"Learn English by Pocket Passport"},"metadata":{"simpleText":"Pocket Passport’s YouTube channel is for anyone who wants to learn everyday English in a fun and practical way. Hundreds of English conversations and passages to learn grammar, phrases, idioms and improve your English listening naturally. \n\nOur short, bite-sized videos are between one and three minutes long and perfect for beginner to high intermediate ESL learners. Our daily English conversations and passages are based on real-world topics like: Introducing Yourself, Food, Travel, Telling Stories, the Future, Giving Instructions, Seasons, Culture, Holidays, Health, Weather, and more!\n\nOur English grammar videos are fun, animated videos that use lots of illustrations and images to explain grammar points. \n\nBecome a Pocket Passport member and enjoy our library of videos, MP3s, flashcards, quizzes, storytelling activities, and lots more. \n\nFrom beginner English to intermediate English, we have you covered!\n\nQuestions? support@pocketpassport.com \n\n"},"callToAction":{"simpleText":"TRUY CẬP KÊNH"},"dismiss":{"simpleText":"HỦY"},"endpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAYQ-N4BGAAiEwje8_qxp86QAxUrRPUFHcX6COsyDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbkj35d6rp8zUl68BygEEK-yB5Q==","commandMetadata"